<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Change Your Life</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Iggy Azalea, T.I.</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">The New Classic</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1QJLm4mdmqRkXXbHc4pYWY</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.598" end="00:02.192">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.192" end="00:03.692">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.660" end="00:05.424">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.424" end="00:07.154">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.154" end="00:09.134">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.134" end="00:11.054">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.054" end="00:12.622">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.622" end="00:14.558">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.558" end="00:16.058">You used to dealing with basic bitches</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.990" end="00:18.138">Basic bullshit all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.138" end="00:20.129">I'm a new classic, upgrade your status</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.129" end="00:21.629">From a standby to a frequent flyer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.379" end="00:23.036">Hopped out your past life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.036" end="00:24.966">And I renovate your future</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.966" end="00:28.358">Then I integrate my genius bullshit we purchasing, not cruisin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.358" end="00:30.815">Yea I love your hustle, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.815" end="00:32.315">Send me a little bit of hustle bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.310" end="00:34.645">Join Vin, she will partner up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.645" end="00:36.383">Until the shares are up and I up your wages</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.383" end="00:37.883">On a private island, dolo</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.874" end="00:39.595">But one mill castacogno</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.595" end="00:41.272">Them broads before me was locals</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.272" end="00:43.598">Cost them to custom your wardrobes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.598" end="00:47.214">Damn, same passport for the all transport til the cops fast forward</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.214" end="00:49.026">And we got blue shows</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.026" end="00:51.302">When they don’t do chores we just fix yo foreign</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.302" end="00:52.802">Damn, this is the life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.609" end="00:54.324">Exclusive bullshit with all access granted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.324" end="00:56.656">In the country where they have sense of grand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.656" end="00:58.817">And they landin on top of foreign mansions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.817" end="01:01.090">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.090" end="01:02.590">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.112" end="01:03.648">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.648" end="01:05.578">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.578" end="01:07.504">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.504" end="01:09.097">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.097" end="01:10.940">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.940" end="01:12.440">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.106" end="01:14.019">If you could listen more than you speak</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.019" end="01:15.716">I get you everything that you need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.716" end="01:17.736">I'm talking bout red bottoms LV</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.736" end="01:19.493">Even extensions plugs in your weave</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.493" end="01:21.290">I be blowing on strong weed when we ride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.290" end="01:22.980">And everybody just lookin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.980" end="01:25.032">But when that bitch go holla</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.032" end="01:26.764">They like nah shawty she tooken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.764" end="01:28.985">I’mma get you about that cold shower</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.985" end="01:30.700">Pick you up in a month and you gon shout</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.700" end="01:32.382">And let me tell you that watch is pulled with</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.382" end="01:34.653">And get up out of that Honda Civic, get yo ass in here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.653" end="01:36.153">To your mom and dad you strange</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.039" end="01:37.539">Don’t worry bout it, you got here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.529" end="01:39.938">You fly over and go get fly back in the Jeep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.938" end="01:41.906">Hustle Gang on yo chest, ain’t no trouble, don’t stress</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.906" end="01:45.008">We spend our winters in the Summer of Australia</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.008" end="01:46.588">Eating crumpets with the sailors</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.588" end="01:48.520">On acres without the neighbors</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.520" end="01:50.710">We fast-forward four years more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.710" end="01:52.523">We long way from rain pourin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.523" end="01:54.284">And all the bullshit that we endured</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.284" end="01:56.379">I told you what you was in for so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.379" end="01:58.225">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.225" end="01:59.897">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.897" end="02:01.836">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.836" end="02:03.476">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.476" end="02:05.282">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.282" end="02:07.114">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.114" end="02:08.890">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.890" end="02:10.489">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.489" end="02:13.075">Once you go grace, you never go good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.075" end="02:16.594">You never go back, even if you could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.594" end="02:20.402">I'll show you my way, I got that good-good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.402" end="02:22.414">You never go back, even if you could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.414" end="02:30.414">Have you ever wished your life would change?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.050" end="02:34.537">Woke up and you lived your dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.537" end="02:37.824">Baby I can help you make that change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.824" end="02:40.718">I can show you how to do this thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.718" end="02:45.174">Have you ever wished your life would change?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.174" end="02:48.710">Woke up and you lived your dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.710" end="02:52.325">Baby I can help you make that change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.325" end="02:53.825">I can show you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.474" end="02:56.471">I'mma change your life i'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.471" end="02:58.153">I'mma change your l</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.153" end="02:59.653">ife (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.234" end="03:00.734">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.228" end="03:02.008">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.008" end="03:03.613">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.613" end="03:05.456">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.456" end="03:07.250">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.250" end="03:08.997">I'mma change your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.997" end="03:11.493">Once you go grace, you never go good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.493" end="03:15.148">You never go back, even if you could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.148" end="03:18.692">I'll show you my way, I got that good-good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.692" end="03:22.371">You never go back, even if you could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.371" end="03:23.871" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Outro)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.628" end="03:25.931">Once you go grace, you never go good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.931" end="03:29.186">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.186" end="03:30.900">I'mma change your life (life)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:30.900" end="03:33.386">I'll show you my way, I got that good-good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.386" end="03:39.447">I'mma change your life, I'mma change it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:39.4